---
# SATSUMAESTRO permission policy. Copy to .satsuma/policy.md and edit.
# SATSUMAESTRO の権限ポリシー。.satsuma/policy.md に写して書き換える。
#
# mode: used when no rule matches / どの規則にも当たらないときの動き
#   read-only           read only; the rest asks / 読み取りだけ。ほかは確認
#   workspace-write     also writes in the workspace (default) / 作業場所の中への書き込みまで（既定）
#   danger-full-access  almost everything / ほぼすべて
#   prompt              always ask / 常に確認
#   allow               always allow / 常に許可
mode: workspace-write
---

# Order (strongest first) / 優先の順（強い順）:
#   Denied tools > Deny > Ask > Allow > mode
#
# Rules / 規則:
#   - <tool>                          whole tool (* = any) / ツール全体（* はどれでも）
#   - <tool> when <field> glob:<pat>  glob match / glob に合うとき
#   - <tool> when <field> re:<regex>  regex match / 正規表現に合うとき
#   <field>: command (bash) | path (files) | url (web)
#
# A rule matches one tool name only: write_file does not cover edit_file.
# 規則はツール名の完全一致。write_file の規則は edit_file には効かない。
#
# Every policy.md from the git root down to the working directory applies.
# git の根から作業ディレクトリまでの policy.md がすべて効く。
#
# Related settings ("permission" in .satsuma/settings.json) / 関係する設定:
#   "bash_auto_allow": "off"                    ask for every bash / bash を毎回確認
#   "secret_access": "deny"                     refuse secret files / 秘密ファイルを拒否
#   "secret_patterns_remove": [".env.example"]  not secret / 秘密の扱いから外す

## Denied tools
# Always refused / 常に拒否
- web_search
- write_file when path glob: **/.git/**

## Deny
- bash when command re: ^\s*rm\s+-rf\s+/
- bash when command re: \bcurl\b.*\|\s*sh
- bash when command re: \bsudo\b
- edit_file when path glob: **/secrets/**
- write_file when path glob: **/.env
- edit_file when path glob: **/.env
- append_file when path glob: **/.env

## Ask
# Asks in repl, refused in prompt / repl では確認、prompt では拒否
- bash when command re: ^\s*git\s+push
- bash when command re: ^\s*git\s+commit
- web_fetch
# Orchestration and worker tools (only when enabled) / オーケストレーションと worker（有効にしたときだけ）
- task_create
- task_stop
- task_update
- team_create
- team_delete
- cron_create
- cron_delete
- worker_create
- worker_resolve_trust
- worker_send_prompt
- worker_restart
- worker_terminate

## Allow
# Allowed within the mode above / 上の mode の範囲で許可
- read_file
- grep_search
- write_file when path glob: src/**
- edit_file when path glob: src/**
# MCP tools ask by default; exact names only / MCP のツールは既定で確認。名前は完全一致
- mcp__filesystem__read_file

## Tool requirements
# Mode a tool needs, to override the default / ツールが求めるモード（既定を変えるときだけ）
- bash: danger-full-access
- read_file: read-only
